  "prefLabel": "He-M 306.03 Emergency Treatment Authorized",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 306.03 Emergency Treatment Authorized.\n\n(a) A licensed practitioner, or a person acting under the direction of a licensed practitioner, shall administer medical or psychiatric treatment to a patient, without the consent of the patient, when authorization is granted by the presiding officer pursuant to the provisions of this part.\n\n(b) Emergency treatment shall not include:\n\n(1) Psychosurgery;\n\n(2) Electroconvulsive therapy;\n\n(3) Sterilization; or\n\n(4) Experimental treatment of any kind.\n\nSource. #3096, eff 8-19-85; EXPIRED: 8-19-91\n\nNew. #4708, eff 12-1-89, EXPIRED: 12-1-95\n\nNew. #7133, eff 11-23-99; ss by #7559, eff 9-25-01; ss by #9520, eff 8-4-09, EXPIRED: 8-4-18\n\nNew. #13035, EMERGENCY, eff 4-14-20, EXPIRES: 10-11-20; ss by #13108, eff 9-22-20; ss by #14637, eff 6-26-26, EXPIRES: 6-26-36",
